      "pClass": "productdescription",
      "pText": "Baobab is a park bench from the Woody series, with a slatted seat and backrest in dark brown on angled black legs. It seats 3 to 4 people and measures 6'6\" x 2'6\". Set beside a play area, it gives parents a place to sit and watch without standing inside a safe zone. Housing societies, resorts, public parks and college campuses also use benches like this along walking paths and lawns. The brown finish matches the other Woody pieces, so a site can keep one look across its play equipment and seating. It is garden furniture, so it does not need impact flooring. Our 3-year warranty on galvanised pipe and composite laminates applies to the parts made of those materials. Tell us how many benches your layout needs and where your paths run."
